    "No direct brain/plasma or CSF measurement exists for the exact 2,4-dimorpholino-triazine scaffold.",
    "Potential efflux liability of the triazine core is not directly measured in the retrieved records, though close morpholine-containing analogues showed negligible P-gp efflux."
  ],
